    5. Assign each legend color to one block. Decide type per block (0-2 solid, rest encoded).
    6. For solid blocks, fill 5x5 with legend color. For encoded blocks, pick a random D4 variant of the legend shape, center it in inner 3x3 with marker_color on base_color.
    7. Assemble 18x22 grid with bg=0, panel, and blocks.
